import{_ as e,W as a,X as n,a2 as i}from"./framework-6a3aa88c.js";const s={},d=i(`<h1 id="第五课-pod-生命周期与第一次故障排查" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#第五课-pod-生命周期与第一次故障排查" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 第五课：Pod 生命周期与第一次故障排查</h1><h2 id="这节课只解决两个问题" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#这节课只解决两个问题" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 这节课只解决两个问题</h2><ol><li>Pod 从创建到运行，状态为什么会变化？</li><li>Pod 起不来时，第一步应该查什么？</li></ol><p>我们会故意写错 Nginx 镜像版本，让 Kubernetes 无法下载镜像，然后沿证据找到原因。</p><h2 id="一、先理解-生命周期" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#一、先理解-生命周期" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 一、先理解“生命周期”</h2><p>生命周期就是一个 Pod 从被创建，到运行，再到结束所经历的过程。</p><p>正常 Pod 的简化过程：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>提交创建请求
    ↓
等待安排运行位置
    ↓
准备镜像和容器
    ↓
容器开始运行
    ↓
Pod 结束或被删除
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>使用 <code>kubectl get pod -w</code> 时，常见的显示变化是：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Pending → ContainerCreating → Running
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>现在逐个解释。</p><h2 id="二、pending-已经创建-但还没运行起来" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#二、pending-已经创建-但还没运行起来" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 二、<code>Pending</code>：已经创建，但还没运行起来</h2><p><code>Pending</code> 可以翻译为“等待中”。</p><p>它表示 Kubernetes 已经接受并创建了 Pod 对象，但 Pod 里的容器还没有全部运行起来。</p><p>等待原因可能不同，例如：</p><ul><li>还在选择运行机器；</li><li>还在下载镜像；</li><li>没有足够 CPU 或内存；</li><li>需要的存储没有准备好。</li></ul><p>所以看到 Pending 时，不能只凭这个单词猜原因，还要继续看 Events。</p><h2 id="三、containercreating-正在准备容器" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#三、containercreating-正在准备容器" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 三、<code>ContainerCreating</code>：正在准备容器</h2><p><code>ContainerCreating</code> 可以理解为“正在创建容器”。</p><p>这个阶段可能正在：</p><ul><li>下载镜像；</li><li>准备容器网络；</li><li>挂载需要的文件或存储；</li><li>创建容器。</li></ul><p>持续几秒通常很正常。如果长时间不变化，再查看 Events 判断卡在哪一步。</p><h2 id="四、running-容器已经开始运行" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#四、running-容器已经开始运行" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 四、<code>Running</code>：容器已经开始运行</h2><p><code>Running</code> 表示 Pod 已经被安排到一台机器，并且至少有一个容器处于运行或启动过程中。</p><p>上一课已经强调：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Running 不等于网页一定正确
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>还要结合 <code>READY</code>、日志和实际请求判断应用是否可用。</p><h2 id="五、先重新观察一次正常启动" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#五、先重新观察一次正常启动" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 五、先重新观察一次正常启动</h2><p>进入课程目录：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code><span class="token builtin class-name">cd</span> /Users/qintianpeng/2026/code/k8s
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>创建正常 Nginx Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl apply <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> labs/02-第一个应用/01-nginx-pod.yaml
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>持续观察：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pod qingyun-mall-web-preview <span class="token parameter variable">-w</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>可能看到：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>qingyun-mall-web-preview   0/1   ContainerCreating   0   1s
qingyun-mall-web-preview   1/1   Running             0   3s
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>如果镜像已经在电脑中，启动可能很快，不一定看得到每个中间状态。这不表示 Kubernetes 跳过了准备过程，只是终端没有及时显示瞬间状态。</p><p>看到 <code>Running</code> 后按 <code>Control + C</code>。</p><p>查看近期事件：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl describe pod qingyun-mall-web-preview
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>滚到最下面的 <code>Events</code>，通常能看到：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Scheduled → Pulled → Created → Started
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>白话解释：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>选择机器 → 准备镜像 → 创建容器 → 启动容器
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="六、制造一个错误镜像" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#六、制造一个错误镜像" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 六、制造一个错误镜像</h2><p>本课的故障文件：<code>labs/04-Pod生命周期/01-错误镜像Pod.yaml</code></p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">apiVersion</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> v1
<span class="token key atrule">kind</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> Pod
<span class="token key atrule">metadata</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
  <span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> qingyun<span class="token punctuation">-</span>mall<span class="token punctuation">-</span>web<span class="token punctuation">-</span>image<span class="token punctuation">-</span>error
<span class="token key atrule">spec</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
  <span class="token key atrule">containers</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token punctuation">-</span> <span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> web
      <span class="token key atrule">image</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx<span class="token punctuation">:</span>lesson<span class="token punctuation">-</span>version<span class="token punctuation">-</span>does<span class="token punctuation">-</span>not<span class="token punctuation">-</span>exist
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>问题在这里：</p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">image</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx<span class="token punctuation">:</span>lesson<span class="token punctuation">-</span>version<span class="token punctuation">-</span>does<span class="token punctuation">-</span>not<span class="token punctuation">-</span>exist
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>冒号后面是镜像标签，可以先理解为镜像版本。这个标签是我们故意编造的，因此镜像仓库中不存在。</p><p>创建故障 Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl apply <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> labs/04-Pod生命周期/01-错误镜像Pod.yaml
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>观察：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pod qingyun-mall-web-image-error <span class="token parameter variable">-w</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>可能依次看到：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Pending
ErrImagePull
ImagePullBackOff
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>看到 <code>ImagePullBackOff</code> 后按 <code>Control + C</code>。</p><h2 id="七、看懂-errimagepull-和-imagepullbackoff" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#七、看懂-errimagepull-和-imagepullbackoff" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 七、看懂 <code>ErrImagePull</code> 和 <code>ImagePullBackOff</code></h2><h3 id="errimagepull" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#errimagepull" aria-hidden="true">#</a> ErrImagePull</h3><p>可以直接理解为：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>拉取镜像失败
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h3 id="imagepullbackoff" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#imagepullbackoff" aria-hidden="true">#</a> ImagePullBackOff</h3><p>它表示镜像拉取失败后，Kubernetes 不会无间隔疯狂重试，而是等待一段时间再试；多次失败后，等待时间会逐步增加。</p><p><code>BackOff</code> 可以理解为“退避等待”。</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>拉取失败
  ↓
稍等后重试
  ↓
仍然失败
  ↓
等待更久后再试
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>重要的是：如果镜像名称或标签本身就是错的，只等待不会解决问题。必须修正配置。</p><h2 id="八、第一步-用-get-确认现象" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#八、第一步-用-get-确认现象" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 八、第一步：用 <code>get</code> 确认现象</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pod qingyun-mall-web-image-error
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>可能看到：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>NAME                  READY   STATUS             RESTARTS   AGE
qingyun-mall-web-image-error   0/1     ImagePullBackOff   0          ...
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这一步告诉我们：</p><ul><li>Pod 对象存在；</li><li>容器没有就绪；</li><li>问题与拉取镜像有关。</li></ul><p>但它还没有告诉我们究竟哪个镜像、为什么拉取失败。</p><h2 id="九、第二步-用-describe-找原因" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#九、第二步-用-describe-找原因" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 九、第二步：用 <code>describe</code> 找原因</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl describe pod qingyun-mall-web-image-error
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>先找 <code>Containers</code> 部分，可以看到配置的镜像：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Image: nginx:lesson-version-does-not-exist
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>再看底部 <code>Events</code>，通常能看到类似信息：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Failed to pull image
not found
Back-off pulling image
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>至此证据链完整：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>现象：READY 0/1，STATUS ImagePullBackOff
    ↓
配置：镜像是 nginx:lesson-version-does-not-exist
    ↓
事件：Failed to pull image / not found
    ↓
结论：镜像标签不存在，容器无法启动
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这就是排障的基本方式：不是看到错误名后猜测，而是继续查看事件中的具体原因。</p><h2 id="十、为什么现在-logs-看不到应用日志" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十、为什么现在-logs-看不到应用日志" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十、为什么现在 <code>logs</code> 看不到应用日志</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl logs qingyun-mall-web-image-error
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>会得到类似提示：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>container ... is waiting to start: trying and failing to pull image
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>原因很简单：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>镜像没有下载成功
→ 容器没有创建成功
→ Nginx 程序从未启动
→ 自然没有 Nginx 运行日志
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这也告诉我们，排障工具有使用顺序：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>容器还没启动：重点看 get 和 Events
容器已经启动：logs 才更可能提供应用线索
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="十一、一个容易混淆的细节" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十一、一个容易混淆的细节" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十一、一个容易混淆的细节</h2><p>执行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pod qingyun-mall-web-image-error <span class="token parameter variable">-o</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">jsonpath</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token string">&#39;{.status.phase}{&quot;\\n&quot;}&#39;</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>输出很可能仍是：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Pending
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>但普通 <code>kubectl get pod</code> 的 <code>STATUS</code> 列显示：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>ImagePullBackOff
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这并不矛盾：</p><ul><li>Pod 的大阶段仍是 Pending，也就是容器还没全部启动；</li><li><code>STATUS</code> 列为了方便排障，展示了更具体的当前原因 <code>ImagePullBackOff</code>。</li></ul><p>初学时可以这样理解：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-ext="text"><pre class="language-text"><code>Pending：大的等待阶段
ImagePullBackOff：此刻为什么还在等待
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="十二、正确处理方式" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十二、正确处理方式" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十二、正确处理方式</h2><p>真实工作中应该把镜像标签改成存在的版本，例如：</p><div class="language-yaml line-numbers-mode" data-ext="yml"><pre class="language-yaml"><code><span class="token key atrule">image</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> nginx<span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token number">1.27</span>
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>但这一课已有正常 Pod，所以不修改故障文件。我们保留它，后面还可以重复练习故障排查。</p><h2 id="十三、清理两个实验-pod" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十三、清理两个实验-pod" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十三、清理两个实验 Pod</h2><p>先删除故障 Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl delete <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> labs/04-Pod生命周期/01-错误镜像Pod.yaml
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>再删除正常 Pod：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl delete <span class="token parameter variable">-f</span> labs/02-第一个应用/01-nginx-pod.yaml
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>确认它们都不存在：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pod qingyun-mall-web-image-error
kubectl get pod qingyun-mall-web-preview
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>两条命令都返回 <code>NotFound</code>，表示清理完成。</p><h2 id="十四、问题与直接回答" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#十四、问题与直接回答" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 十四、问题与直接回答</h2><h3 id="pending-表示一定没有机器可用吗" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#pending-表示一定没有机器可用吗" aria-hidden="true">#</a> Pending 表示一定没有机器可用吗？</h3><p>不是。Pending 只表示 Pod 已创建，但容器还没有全部运行。镜像下载、资源、存储或调度都可能让它处于 Pending。</p><h3 id="containercreating-持续几秒是不是故障" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#containercreating-持续几秒是不是故障" aria-hidden="true">#</a> ContainerCreating 持续几秒是不是故障？</h3><p>通常不是。拉取镜像和准备容器需要时间。只有长时间不变化时，才需要结合 Events 判断。</p><h3 id="imagepullbackoff-是什么" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#imagepullbackoff-是什么" aria-hidden="true">#</a> ImagePullBackOff 是什么？</h3><p>镜像拉取失败，并且 Kubernetes 正在采用逐渐延长等待时间的方式重试。</p><h3 id="imagepullbackoff-等久一点一定会好吗" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#imagepullbackoff-等久一点一定会好吗" aria-hidden="true">#</a> ImagePullBackOff 等久一点一定会好吗？</h3><p>不一定。临时网络故障可能自行恢复，但镜像名、标签或仓库权限错误必须修正。</p><h3 id="为什么故障-pod-没有-nginx-日志" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#为什么故障-pod-没有-nginx-日志" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 为什么故障 Pod 没有 Nginx 日志？</h3><p>因为镜像都没有拉取成功，容器和 Nginx 程序从未真正启动。</p><h3 id="pod-起不来时最先执行什么" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#pod-起不来时最先执行什么" aria-hidden="true">#</a> Pod 起不来时最先执行什么？</h3><p>固定从下面两条开始：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-ext="sh"><pre class="language-bash"><code>kubectl get pod Pod名称
kubectl describe pod Pod名称
</code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>先确定现象，再从 Events 找具体原因。</p><h2 id="本课只记住五句话" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#本课只记住五句话" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 本课只记住五句话</h2><ol><li>Pending 表示 Pod 已创建，但容器尚未全部运行。</li><li>ContainerCreating 表示正在准备镜像、网络和容器。</li><li>ImagePullBackOff 表示拉取镜像失败后正在退避重试。</li><li>Pod 起不来，先看 <code>get</code>，再看 <code>describe</code> 底部 Events。</li><li>容器从未启动时没有应用日志，不能只盯着 <code>logs</code>。</li></ol><h2 id="下一课预告" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#下一课预告" aria-hidden="true">#</a> 下一课预告</h2><p>下一课第一次接触 Deployment。你会亲手删除一个正在运行的 Pod，然后看到 Kubernetes 自动补回一个新的 Pod，从实操中真正理解第一课提到的“持续纠偏”。</p>`,135),l=[d];function r(c,t){return a(),n("div",null,l)}const o=e(s,[["render",r],["__file","06-第五课-Pod生命周期与第一次排障.html.vue"]]);export{o as default};
